    "name": "Arcadian Days",
    "steam_appid": 3610170,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/49b03b386f16a8fa521b41a19f0a1323.poster.avif?t=1754952870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/49b03b386f16a8fa521b41a19f0a1323.webm?t=1754952870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/49b03b386f16a8fa521b41a19f0a1323.mp4?t=1754952870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is your story to tell.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bArcadian Days is a first-person exploration-adventure game that sets free your sense of child-like wonder and joy for the world. Explore highly detailed and vibrant environments packed with secrets, shape a dynamic narrative, develop your homestead and play with your loyal dog companion!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Stories That Unfold Naturally</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two playthroughs are alike:</strong> your interactions and observations influence the story and the world:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emergent storytelling:</strong> Dive into narratives that unfold naturally, shaped by your actions and discoveries, making every playthrough uniquely personal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic family relationships:</strong> Deepen your bonds with your family through simple, organic interactions. Shape their vocations and future by guiding them towards farming, animal husbandry, or pottery, among many others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental storytelling cues:</strong> Have you noticed subtle changes in the landscape? Certain environmental details hint at evolving stories, inviting exploration and keen observation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With hundreds of narrative possibilities</strong>, every playthrough will be different.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/1671685f3ed56a4554323bb5cc703825.avif?t=1754952870\" data-has-big width=800 height=582 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/8480807e12644c45036376eaf41adb05.poster.avif?t=1754952870\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/8480807e12644c45036376eaf41adb05.webm?t=1754952870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/8480807e12644c45036376eaf41adb05.mp4?t=1754952870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Discover a one-of-a-kind world, presented in AAA-level detail</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bEmbark on a journey through the meticulously crafted world of <i>Arcadian Days</i>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Biomes</strong>: Traverse five distinct biomes -\u00a0from a lush forest, expansive hills and climb up towards a fantastic fortress on a step hill - that evolve daily,  influenced by both the passage of time and your choices, ensuring a unique experience with each playthrough.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cultural Immersion</strong>: Become part of the <strong>Dragobete family</strong> and explore their unique customs, traditions, and a unique dialect. As one of them, you\u2019ll gain an authentic glimpse into their way of life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meticulous design:</strong> Explore densely populated maps where every element is thoughtfully placed, promising breathtaking scenery and hidden secrets around every corner.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/8d56960559ef640e15e080ddef508563.avif?t=1754952870\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Explore at Your Own Pace</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hard quests. No combat. No frills. Just you, your dog Tola, and a world full of secrets waiting to be uncovered through curiosity, attention, and play. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track Miela's thoughts and discoveries through the 'Story Map' and see where your curiosity takes you. There is no wrong or right path in Arcadian Days.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Minimalist Design for Maximum Immersion</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimalist interface that allows for a staggering amount of interaction and choice with the world around you. Simple, tactile actions that reflect a child's view of the world\u2014creative, emotional, and free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/fefcf95d3cdee8f5fa68aef8e5c722ce.poster.avif?t=1754952870\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/fefcf95d3cdee8f5fa68aef8e5c722ce.webm?t=1754952870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/fefcf95d3cdee8f5fa68aef8e5c722ce.mp4?t=1754952870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community on Discord for announcements, development updates, behind-the-scenes content, and more!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/49b03b386f16a8fa521b41a19f0a1323.poster.avif?t=1754952870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/49b03b386f16a8fa521b41a19f0a1323.webm?t=1754952870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/49b03b386f16a8fa521b41a19f0a1323.mp4?t=1754952870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is your story to tell.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bArcadian Days is a first-person exploration-adventure game that sets free your sense of child-like wonder and joy for the world. Explore highly detailed and vibrant environments packed with secrets, shape a dynamic narrative, develop your homestead and play with your loyal dog companion!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Stories That Unfold Naturally</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two playthroughs are alike:</strong> your interactions and observations influence the story and the world:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emergent storytelling:</strong> Dive into narratives that unfold naturally, shaped by your actions and discoveries, making every playthrough uniquely personal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic family relationships:</strong> Deepen your bonds with your family through simple, organic interactions. Shape their vocations and future by guiding them towards farming, animal husbandry, or pottery, among many others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental storytelling cues:</strong> Have you noticed subtle changes in the landscape? Certain environmental details hint at evolving stories, inviting exploration and keen observation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With hundreds of narrative possibilities</strong>, every playthrough will be different.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/1671685f3ed56a4554323bb5cc703825.avif?t=1754952870\" data-has-big width=800 height=582 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/8480807e12644c45036376eaf41adb05.poster.avif?t=1754952870\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/8480807e12644c45036376eaf41adb05.webm?t=1754952870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/8480807e12644c45036376eaf41adb05.mp4?t=1754952870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Discover a one-of-a-kind world, presented in AAA-level detail</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bEmbark on a journey through the meticulously crafted world of <i>Arcadian Days</i>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Biomes</strong>: Traverse five distinct biomes -\u00a0from a lush forest, expansive hills and climb up towards a fantastic fortress on a step hill - that evolve daily,  influenced by both the passage of time and your choices, ensuring a unique experience with each playthrough.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cultural Immersion</strong>: Become part of the <strong>Dragobete family</strong> and explore their unique customs, traditions, and a unique dialect. As one of them, you\u2019ll gain an authentic glimpse into their way of life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meticulous design:</strong> Explore densely populated maps where every element is thoughtfully placed, promising breathtaking scenery and hidden secrets around every corner.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/8d56960559ef640e15e080ddef508563.avif?t=1754952870\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Explore at Your Own Pace</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hard quests. No combat. No frills. Just you, your dog Tola, and a world full of secrets waiting to be uncovered through curiosity, attention, and play. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track Miela's thoughts and discoveries through the 'Story Map' and see where your curiosity takes you. There is no wrong or right path in Arcadian Days.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Minimalist Design for Maximum Immersion</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimalist interface that allows for a staggering amount of interaction and choice with the world around you. Simple, tactile actions that reflect a child's view of the world\u2014creative, emotional, and free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/fefcf95d3cdee8f5fa68aef8e5c722ce.poster.avif?t=1754952870\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/fefcf95d3cdee8f5fa68aef8e5c722ce.webm?t=1754952870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/fefcf95d3cdee8f5fa68aef8e5c722ce.mp4?t=1754952870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community on Discord for announcements, development updates, behind-the-scenes content, and more!</p>",
